Every unresolved entry is an indirect store whose pointer this analysis does not constrain.
No inductive state invariant can be established while any remains, so obligation C stays open.

$071F, the $92C8 index, has 2 exact writer(s) among reached instructions: 0x92B7 STY, 0x92BF DEC
Both are in the dispatch's own routine, which is why RAM[$071F] <= 8 is supportable
but not proved: the indexed and indirect stores above are not ruled out.

